 "about": "Point records with an optional sell-through sample (contract points-v2, Oro de Hermandad 0.6.0). Text record: 't,lo,qty,qty5' or 't,lo,qty,qty5,dt,sold'. records: [t, lo, qty, qty5, dt|null, sold|null] after decode + normalize. dt in [600, 7200] s and sold in [0, 1000000] are a sample only when both are valid decimal integers; otherwise the point is kept without a sample. Points less than 1800 s after the first point of a group merge into it: t of the first, lo = min, qty = max, qty5 of the cheaper point (equal lo: the larger qty5), and the sample with the larger dt (equal dt: the larger sold); a point without sample never removes one. Newest 120 kept. encoded: what EncodePoints writes. sold: the upload 'sold' list of the series, [[t, dt, sold], ...]. sameTime: the server's merge of a stored point and a resent one with the same t (src/guild.mjs mergePoint).",
